 accept, my cost is: I cover 2 Reds for you, and in return you cover 2 Blues for me.  \n- On this plan, I reach the goal and maximize my chip count.\n\nI do not gain *extra* chips compared to any purely Blue-based path, but there is literally no way for me to get to (3,3) without the contract, so it results in a strictly higher score for me versus no trade (0 points vs 20+chips).\n\nAs a purely selfish agent, I only agree to deals that let me reach my goal and cost me the minimum. Your deal satisfies these conditions and I have no incentive to negotiate further, as neither side has negotiating leverage.\n\n**I accept your contract:**\n\n- (1,0): You give me a Blue  \n- (2,0): You give me a Blue  \n- (1,2): I give you a Red  \n- (1,3): I give you a Red\n\nagree \n, \nplayer 0: agree \n",
